Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.26,0:01:54.59,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}EPISODE 10:\N "THE TECHNIQUE FOR RECOVERY"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:56.73,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Lancet needles?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.73,0:01:57.78,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Watch out, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.35,0:02:11.73,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Xiaozai, don't let him get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:29.35,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,We meet again, Black Owl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.35,0:02:32.58,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Don't waste your breath. \NJust beat him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:44.26,Default,Black Owl,0,0,0,,Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.13,0:02:45.97,Italics,Oboi,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.28,0:02:55.40,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Oboi. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.13,0:02:57.11,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,I'm frozen in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.11,0:02:58.65,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,He sealed your pressure points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.00,0:02:59.99,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Let me take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:12.12,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:46.20,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,All style, no substance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:54.87,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Don't fall for that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.18,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,He ran off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.13,0:05:17.25,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,D-D-Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:18.23,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.23,0:05:20.72,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,It's so late. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.72,0:05:22.70,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,I was going to ask {\i1}you{\i0} that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:26.04,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,Someone suddenly ran in here\N and started fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.04,0:05:27.74,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,All I could do was hide here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:36.36,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,I normally wait until everyone's gone,\N then study in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:41.44,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,His Majesty's been feeling ill, \Nso I wanted to help any way I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:46.16,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,I was reading earlier, too. \NBut shortly after I started...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:49.84,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,Huh? Shuang Mei, um, \Nwh-who are these cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.28,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.28,0:05:52.82,Italics,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Not sure how to cover for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.82,0:05:54.51,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,What are they doing with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.51,0:05:55.75,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Uh, they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:58.04,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,I'm Ping'an, a nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.39,0:06:01.86,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,I was passing by when \NI heard strange noises.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:03.21,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,I came to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:05.35,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,The big tom and I were patrolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:08.96,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,We saw a suspicious character come in \Nhere, so we chased after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:11.53,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,Didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.43,0:06:13.60,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:15.10,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Shuang Mei, who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:17.44,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,This is my colleague.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:19.94,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Wu You, a physician \Nof the Imperial Academy of Medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:24.86,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}WU YOU\NPHYSICIAN, IMPERIAL ACADEMY OF MEDICINE
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:21.56,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,Wu You is my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.65,0:06:24.37,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.03,0:06:28.03,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Huh? What're you lookin' at?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.59,0:06:30.71,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,S-Scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.42,0:06:32.41,top,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Cool it. Don't scare him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:34.58,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,It's his fault for being a scaredy-cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:36.32,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,It just seems suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:39.98,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Hey, did you see which way \Nthe cat who escaped went?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:43.99,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Or is the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:46.24,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,that he didn't run off at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:48.63,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,and is instead pretending\N to be an innocent bystander?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:51.34,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,You sure are a great actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:53.72,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,It was all you, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:06:58.72,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Hey. Wu You...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.72,0:07:00.52,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Wow, he passed out right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:02.88,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Wu You?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:04.48,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Wu You?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.48,0:07:15.91,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Couldn't you have talked to him normally?\NYou just {\i1}had{\i0} to scare him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:18.02,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.02,0:07:20.32,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,I just asked a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.15,0:07:28.05,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,What's that? Let me have a sniff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.33,0:07:31.88,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,What are you two doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:33.24,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Take a sniff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.17,0:07:38.36,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,Let me have another sniff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:45.98,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Will you cats be quiet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.69,0:07:51.06,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,You're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:57.26,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,Oh my. Wh-What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.26,0:07:59.58,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,These are extremely precious\N medicinal herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.58,0:08:03.04,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,This is all wrong. \NThey're all in the wrong order...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:06.07,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,I cleaned it up for you. Don't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.53,0:08:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:06.65,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:08.38,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,{\an8}I just remembered I had something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:09.74,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,{\an8}You saw that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:12.63,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,This one is star anise. \NThis one is Guangdong star anise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:15.80,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,Star anise grows in clusters \Nand is shaped like an eight-pointed star.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.80,0:08:18.26,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,It's usually dark brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:20.33,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,Guangdong star anise is slightly smaller,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:23.85,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,and has ten to thirteen points \Nthat curve upwards like a bird's beak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:25.93,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,These are easy to tell apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.51,0:08:28.36,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,That one in your hands is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.67,0:08:31.20,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Physician Wu, \Nwhy don't we work together
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.20,0:08:33.36,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,and put the herbs back \Nin their original places?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.21,0:08:35.36,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:37.90,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,All right. Let's get to work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.90,0:08:40.93,Default,Oboi/Xiaozai/Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.93,0:08:44.82,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,This is gotu kola. \NIt goes in the third row, fifth drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:48.92,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,This is black false hellebore and ginseng.\NYou must keep them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.13,0:08:53.29,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. Put that in the second drawer\Non the bottom row there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.74,0:08:58.67,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,Wait. That wild aconite is poisonous. \NIt needs to be in the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.67,0:08:59.68,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,Give it to me. To me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.99,0:09:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.99,0:09:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:20.20,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,We're finally almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.03,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,This isn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.03,0:09:24.74,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,Indeed. We're lucky the Dragon\NMedicine Cabinet wasn't knocked over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:26.21,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,It would've taken even longer then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.15,0:09:31.17,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,This is the Dragon Medicine Cabinet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:33.14,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}BLACK LACQUER GOLDEN DRAGON \NMEDICINE CABINET
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.14,0:09:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:38.14,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,It is intricately crafted and holds \Na variety of precious medicinal herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:41.42,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,Look. The central drawer can rotate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.42,0:09:43.42,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,Each drawer has three sections.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:45.60,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,The herb names are written on the fronts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:48.65,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,It currently holds 143 kinds\N of medicinal herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:50.89,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,One hundred and forty three kinds?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.89,0:09:51.83,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.83,0:09:54.65,Default,Wu You,0,0,0,,Some herbs look very similar \Nand are easy to get mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:09:58.89,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.89,0:09:59.94,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.94,0:10:01.87,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,Oboi! Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:05.40,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Wait. He can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:08.12,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,But what if he loses him? \NI should be his backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.55,0:10:11.84,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,You just want to ditch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.95,0:10:16.36,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,There's only a bit left. \NLet's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:19.97,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Besides, this is where \Nwe encountered Black Owl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:23.96,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,We may be able to find \Nsomething related to the possessed cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.96,0:10:24.73,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:27.27,Default,Meme,0,0,0,,Ping'an, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:29.04,Default,Meme,0,0,0,,What happened just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.04,0:10:31.55,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Wu You was explaining \Nthe Dragon Medicine Cabinet to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:34.17,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,then he suddenly realized\N something and ran out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:35.38,Default,Meme,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:37.43,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Oboi has already gone after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.43,0:10:42.03,Default,Lu Ban,0,0,0,,All right. We can only keep observing. \NWho's next to report?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:42.95,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,Oboi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:45.12,Default,Lu Ban,0,0,0,,Ping'an, continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:48.48,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Right. While posing \Nas a nurse and consulting,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:50.83,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,I heard Noble Consort Zheng\N and Concubine Li
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.14,0:10:53.76,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,discuss the Taichang Emperor's\N physical condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:55.71,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,According to Noble Consort Zheng,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.71,0:11:00.53,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Cui Wensheng should be presenting \Nthe medicine in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.53,0:11:04.60,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,At the moment, the two ladies\N don't seem suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.83,0:11:10.02,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,As for info on Fang Congzhe, \Nwe'll have to wait for Oboi to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:10.56,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.12,0:11:14.14,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Um, uh, how do I explain?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.14,0:11:18.76,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,To put it simply, the nurse\N I'm posing as will probably, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:22.36,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,have to marry Fang's concubine-born son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:23.99,Default,Cats,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.28,0:11:30.56,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:32.36,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,Ping'an and Oboi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.85,0:11:45.89,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:48.22,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,Calm down, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.22,0:11:51.85,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,This is too good. \NIt's such an unexpected pairing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.88,0:11:54.31,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,{\an8}Pairing? We're on a mission! \NTake it seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:57.36,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Ping'an, this is serious.\N Why didn't you tell us sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:11:58.39,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.39,0:12:00.68,Default,Meme,0,0,0,,No way! Not happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:03.92,Default,Meme,0,0,0,,How can a goddess like Ping'an \Nmarry my stinky brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:08.16,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,That's too far, Meme.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.47,0:12:12.66,Default,Meme,0,0,0,,I don't care. Keep acting like that,\NXiaozai, and I won't talk to you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:16.31,Default,Xiaozai,0,0,0,,Huh? Don't be like that. \NThis is Oboi's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:17.34,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Everyone, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:22.71,Default,Lu Ban,0,0,0,,But if we take advantage of this,\N maybe it could work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.71,0:12:26.14,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,No. We need to solve this right away. \NIt could totally derail us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:29.46,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Shush. I agree with Lu Ban.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.46,0:12:33.27,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,This is an opportunity for us \Nto further investigate the Fang household.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.67,0:12:34.40,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,But—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.40,0:12:39.11,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,No buts. Shuang Mei, we must grasp\N this chance and press on with the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.11,0:12:40.97,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.97,0:12:42.41,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,What do you plan to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:49.70,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm going to sit here\N and just accept this arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:50.79,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Naturally, I'm going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.79,0:12:51.87,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,divorce him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:07.26,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.37,0:13:20.75,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Damn. I lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:23.35,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get yelled at.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.40,0:13:27.66,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Why does this place look so familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:29.64,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Huh? The Fang Estate?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.87,0:13:32.75,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}FANG ESTATE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.82,0:13:33.28,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,I might as well just go home for a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.10,0:13:38.33,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,Young Master. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:43.36,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,Young Master, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:51.30,Default,Stranger Physician Cat,0,0,0,,Young Master Fang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.34,0:13:55.27,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:59.20,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,Imperial Academy of Medicine physicians\Nare here to examine you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:04.79,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,You're not needed here. You can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.79,0:14:05.40,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:11.66,Default,Stranger Physician Cat,0,0,0,,Young Master Fang, \Nmay I first read your pulse?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.49,0:14:14.16,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Th-There's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:17.41,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,It's fine for you to come, \Nbut why bring someone? Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.41,0:14:18.58,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Oh? You don't know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.58,0:14:22.02,Default,Stranger Physician Cat,0,0,0,,You heartbreaker. I can't believe \Nyou said you don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:23.42,Default,Stranger Physician Cat,0,0,0,,It's too awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.17,0:14:27.57,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,All right. I'm done teasing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:30.26,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,How's my disguise?\N Still got it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:32.00,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,P-Ping'an?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.11,0:14:35.24,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,You guys scared me half to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:38.98,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,I know I lost track of that cat, \Nbut you don't have to go scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:42.96,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Either way, everything's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.96,0:14:45.11,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.11,0:14:48.39,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Huh? What's starting? \NWhy are you rolling up your sleeves?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:50.82,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Well, naturally...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.82,0:14:52.64,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,We're treating your illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:53.54,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Y-You cats!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.89,0:14:55.19,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,Young Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:58.93,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,Young Master! A-Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.74,0:15:06.62,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,Young Master. You're standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.62,0:15:08.26,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,And you're doing martial arts?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.63,0:15:14.10,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Yup. I'm feeling energized\N and full of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.10,0:15:16.39,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Life cast into burning coals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:22.19,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,Doesn't that last one mean \Nwidespread suffering?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.19,0:15:23.31,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.31,0:15:26.32,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,The point is, I'm cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:28.07,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.68,0:15:34.21,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,Sirs, you are truly skilled in medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.21,0:15:36.71,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,An unknown illness ailed \Nthe young master for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:39.58,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,but the two of you cured him\N in just one visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:41.87,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,I humbly thank you, sirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:45.23,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,I cannot compare to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:47.09,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,You exaggerate. Raise your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:49.60,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,Young master,\N you've only just recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:51.51,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,Please don't exhaust yourself. Rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.89,0:15:53.18,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,That face...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:55.38,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,He looks like the \NImperial Academy physician.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.09,0:15:59.54,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Young fellow, might you also \Nbe trained in medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.41,0:16:02.22,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,I'm ashamed to say I know only a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.22,0:16:05.94,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,Upon meeting you two, \NI now further understand my shortcomings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:09.07,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:12.92,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,The treatment would not have gone \Nso smoothly if not for your devoted care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:18.65,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,If I may, sirs. My elder brother is a \Nphysician at the Imperial Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.65,0:16:21.08,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,I wonder if he has received \Nguidance from you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.08,0:16:23.47,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Oh? Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.47,0:16:26.81,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,My brother is named Wu You.\N My name is Wu Lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.17,0:16:29.13,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}WU LU (YUGAN)\NWU YOU'S YOUNGER BROTHER
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.81,0:16:29.13,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,But everyone calls me Yugan, \Nso I'm now used to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:30.97,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,No wonder you look so familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:33.68,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Basically only the mole \Ndifferentiates the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:35.82,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,We are only alike in appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:38.59,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,I cannot compare in any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.59,0:16:41.05,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,Oh my. Look at me, getting carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.05,0:16:44.91,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,I must report the wonderful news of\Nthe young master's recovery to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.53,0:16:47.71,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,Young Master, sirs, please follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:50.30,Default,Yugan,0,0,0,,{\an8}Master! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:51.66,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Even in this way, they're similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.22,0:16:54.32,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,They're twins, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:17:01.08,Default,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,So they're twin brothers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:19:08.04,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:33.75,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Father! I'm all better now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.75,0:18:34.96,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,Don't believe me? Watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.79,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,I don't want to get married \Nto some nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:41.60,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,I want someone prettier.\NTenderer. With higher status.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:43.98,Default,Oboi,0,0,0,,I don't want some mean,\N angry nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:45.98,Default,Fang Congzhe,0,0,0,,Godly physicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:48.89,Default,Fang Congzhe,0,0,0,,My humble son's head \Nmight need you two to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:53.98,Italics,Shuang Mei,0,0,0,,Someone's trying to destroy\N the medicine records?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.58,0:18:55.69,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Shuang Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:18:58.00,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous. Don't be impulsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:19:02.92,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,Shuang Mei. You like to play hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:05.74,Default,Ping'an,0,0,0,,You brave little kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:12.00,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an8}TRANSLATION (CH): BRIDGET KAN
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:12.00,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an8}TIMING (CH + JP): HENRY LIN
